				<div class="x-element k-6c43dede w w-heading">
					<h2 class="x-heading-title x-size-default">Marketing built for <span class="hl">a booked-out-a-year business</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="x-element k-5256abb9 c-con-full c-flex c-con c-child">
		<div class="x-element k-1ba9acee c-con-full c-flex c-con c-child">
				<div class="x-element k-2b281abc w w-text-editor">
									<p>Dubai is an officially recognised destination-wedding hub, and the UAE&#8217;s bridal calendar runs on its own logic — peak season October through April, driven by cooler weather, with popular Saturdays in November, February and March genuinely filling a year in advance. Marketing that treats this like a typical beauty business, reacting month to month, misses the entire booking window before it even opens.</p>								</div>
				<div class="x-element k-47893d5d w w-heading">
					<h3 class="x-heading-title x-size-default">"Best in Dubai" means nothing — proof does</h3>				</div>
				<div class="x-element k-5590bc86 w w-text-editor">
									<p>Nearly every makeup artist&#8217;s website claims to be &#8220;the best bridal makeup artist in Dubai.&#8221; What actually differentiates a booking decision is consistent portfolio quality across diverse skin tones and wedding traditions, genuine review volume, and a proper trial process — not a superlative claim every competitor makes identically.</p>								</div>
				<div class="x-element k-2a2d8076 w w-heading">
					<h3 class="x-heading-title x-size-default">The trial session is the whole ballgame</h3>				</div>
				<div class="x-element k-6088a6c2 w w-text-editor">
									<p>Scheduled 4-8 weeks before the wedding, the trial is where trust either gets built or lost — and where the deposit gets locked in. A studio&#8217;s booking system and follow-up process around this single appointment matters more than almost anything else in the funnel.</p>								</div>
				</div>
